  "notes": "{論理的|ろんりてき} is a na-adjective meaning logical, rational, or reasoned.\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{論理|ろんり} (logic) + {的|てき} (adjectival suffix)\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverbial: {論理的|ろんりてき}に (logically)\n- Noun modifier: {論理的|ろんりてき}な + noun\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}に{考|かんが}える: to think logically\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}な{説明|せつめい}: logical explanation\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}{思考|しこう}: logical thinking\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {感情的|かんじょうてき}: emotional (opposite approach)\n- {直感的|ちょっかんてき}: intuitive\n- {合理的|ごうりてき}: rational (similar meaning)",
